  "findings": [
    "The reduced Windows environment omits SystemDrive before the patch. Both new process regressions fail before correction.",
    "A real .NET Framework known-folder probe throws ArgumentException for CommonApplicationData/CommonOemLinks without SystemDrive. Adding only SystemDrive removes both errors; adding only PUBLIC does not.",
    "PowerShell Write-Output is fast locally both before and after the change. The exact hosted 20-second Agent-REPL timeout is not reproduced here; a fresh hosted run is required to establish its outcome.",
    "Seven native reduced-environment launchers now retain SystemDrive. Arbitrary inherited secrets stay filtered; explicit host environment removal and values retain precedence.",
    "The unchanged media security fixture fails during real Windows symlink creation (OS1314). Cargo stopped that command before the runtime target; the latter and four actual installed-server gates are executed in the separate follow-up.",
    "Short-TEMP test groups overlap normal-TEMP groups. Scoped tests do not establish whole-native, Linux/macOS, optional-provider or release acceptance."
  ],
